Z||000000||fldevel||05-08-2001||06:51 PM|||| well i was at a picnic today and we made hamburgers and hot dogs on the grill and we had a lil trouble gettting the catchup outa the bottle .. so i thaught id be a smart arse and stuck the bottle in hat lil poutch whare the glove box should be and drove in a circle in the parking lot till the rear end started sliding out .. and wala.. it came outa the bottle ..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> put this one on the letterman show for "stupid fiero tricks"  i think the celica comercial inspired me :P<P> anyone else have any stupid fiero tricks ?||||reg||1
