Z||000005||Ken Wittlief||05-10-2001||02:27 PM||||this isnt so much a trick as a neat discovery.<P>I left the wind deflector off with the sunroof out to see how windy it would be inside the car.<P>driving around town you do get more air and noise inside the car that way<P>but I happened to discover, you can put your right hand up out of the sunroof a little, and if you cup your hand just right you get this great blast of air down onthe top of your head or across your face, its pretty neat.<P>reminds me of when cars (like beetles) had wing vents that you could turn all the way backwards to blast air into the car on a hot day.||||reg||1
